{"cues":[{"sectionId":"intro","start":0,"end":49.76},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":51.04,"end":103.12},{"sectionId":"practice","start":104.56,"end":157.76},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":159.52,"end":224.56}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"intro","start":0,"end":1.04,"text":"來到最後一章，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":1.08,"end":4.56,"text":"我們要把做好的網站整理成可以保存的成果。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":5.36,"end":9.84,"text":"你的個人首頁由三個檔案合作完成：index."},{"sectionId":"intro","start":10,"end":11.52,"text":"html 放內容，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":12.16,"end":12.56,"text":"style."},{"sectionId":"intro","start":12.84,"end":14.48,"text":"css 放樣式，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":15.28,"end":15.76,"text":"app."},{"sectionId":"intro","start":16.08,"end":17.92,"text":"js 放互動程式。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":18.96,"end":22.32,"text":"這裡的 Terminal 是教學用的文字指令介面，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":22.6,"end":25.28,"text":"用來操作目前課程的虛擬檔案，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":25.64,"end":28.32,"text":"並不是你電腦上的系統終端機。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":28.88,"end":30.96,"text":"我們先輸入 ls，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":31.2,"end":33.28,"text":"列出目前目錄中的檔案。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":34.16,"end":35.92,"text":"請確認三個檔案都在，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":36.24,"end":38.64,"text":"再回想它們各自負責什麼。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":39.6,"end":41.12,"text":"這一步看起來簡單，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":41.44,"end":46.24,"text":"卻能避免只保存 HTML、漏掉樣式或程式，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":46.72,"end":49.76,"text":"導致換個地方打開時結果不完整。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":51.04,"end":53.12,"text":"接下來輸入 cat index."},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":53.312,"end":54.08,"text":"html，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":54.48,"end":56,"text":"查看檔案裡的文字。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":57.12,"end":59.28,"text":"Terminal 顯示的是原始碼，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":59.84,"end":65.04,"text":"網站預覽則是瀏覽器解讀這些內容後呈現的畫面。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":65.6,"end":68.32,"text":"我們要找的不只有主標題，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":68.72,"end":70.32,"text":"還包括連到 style."},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":70.56,"end":72.56,"text":"css 的樣式引用，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":72.88,"end":74.88,"text":"以及載入 app."},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":75.147,"end":76.8,"text":"js 的程式引用。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":77.76,"end":81.84,"text":"這些引用告訴瀏覽器另外兩個檔案在哪裡。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":82.48,"end":82.96,"text":"因此，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":83.28,"end":85.2,"text":"下載與搬移網站時，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":85.44,"end":88,"text":"要保留檔名和相對位置。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":88.48,"end":91.84,"text":"你不需要在這一步重寫整份程式，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":92.32,"end":94.96,"text":"先把檔案和畫面對照起來。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":96,"end":96.64,"text":"看完後，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":96.72,"end":101.6,"text":"我們會使用這個教學環境提供的指令開啟預覽，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":101.76,"end":103.12,"text":"再做最後檢查。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":104.56,"end":111.28,"text":"現在請輸入畫面上的預覽指令：python -m http."},{"sectionId":"practice","start":111.429,"end":113.04,"text":"server 8000，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":113.6,"end":115.04,"text":"然後按 Enter。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":116.16,"end":120.48,"text":"這裡要把環境的範圍說清楚：在本課程裡，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":120.56,"end":124.56,"text":"這條指令由教學平台轉接到網站預覽，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":124.8,"end":127.04,"text":"沒有真的啟動 Python 伺服器，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":127.32,"end":130.24,"text":"也不代表網站已經發布到網路。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":131.44,"end":132.48,"text":"預覽出現後，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":132.8,"end":135.52,"text":"確認主標題、綠色按鈕，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":136.32,"end":138.72,"text":"以及按下按鈕後的文字結果。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":139.6,"end":142.48,"text":"完成後按「驗證我的練習」，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":143.12,"end":145.92,"text":"讓系統確認預覽已啟動。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":147.12,"end":149.44,"text":"這頁會停下來留給你操作；"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":149.92,"end":151.52,"text":"如果某個結果不對，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":151.8,"end":157.76,"text":"就回到它負責的 HTML、CSS 或 JavaScript 檔案檢查。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":159.52,"end":161.28,"text":"恭喜你完成這堂課。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":161.84,"end":171.36,"text":"現在我們從學習目標再檢查一次：你能修改 HTML 主標題、調整 CSS 按鈕底色，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":171.72,"end":175.52,"text":"也能用 JavaScript 設定點擊後的文字。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":176.32,"end":177.6,"text":"更重要的是，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":177.72,"end":179.2,"text":"遇到新的需求時，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":179.4,"end":183.28,"text":"你知道先判斷它屬於內容、外觀，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":183.36,"end":184.24,"text":"還是行為。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":185.28,"end":187.92,"text":"請使用網站檔案的下載功能，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":188.16,"end":190.32,"text":"把作品保存成 ZIP。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":191.2,"end":194.32,"text":"這份壓縮檔包含靜態網站的檔案，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":194.68,"end":199.84,"text":"但下載本身不會讓其他人透過網址看到你的網站；"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":200.56,"end":203.72,"text":"公開部署是另外一個步驟。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":204.06,"end":210.56,"text":"本課程到這裡完成的是一份可預覽、可保存的互動個人首頁。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":211.28,"end":215.76,"text":"接下來你可以把練習用的文字換成自己的介紹，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":216.04,"end":220.4,"text":"再用同樣的三種分工逐步擴充作品。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":221.28,"end":222.48,"text":"謝謝各位同學，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":222.72,"end":224.56,"text":"我們下次課程見。"}]}